    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "Create a Brand Kit",
    "long_instructions": "Your client needs a brand kit! As a Brand Designer, you need to make key design decisions for your target user.\r\n\r\n## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Select a fictional product on the canvas. \r\n2. Select a sample user persona.\r\n3. Build a brand kit with:\r\n    - 3–5 color swatches\r\n    - A font pair (heading + body text)\r\n    - 1–2 descriptive style words (e.g., sleek, bold, approachable)\r\n4. **Save your brand kit to your Backpack** when you are finished.\r\n\r\nMake sure your design choices fit your user persona and use readable color combinations and clear typography.\r\n\r\n**Optional:** If you'd like feedback on accessibility, inclusivity, or overall clarity, go back out to Level 2 and use the Brand Kit Helper before saving.\r\n",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Create your brand kit, aligning your colors, fonts, and style words to your chosen user persona.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/9ec2319247c597ffcc1f04ecbd019f2d-graphic-designer.png",
