          },
          {
            "id": "1nZdswJ616y66jjcMI7Eb",
            "type": "shape",
            "position": {
              "x": 585.4824472606914,
              "y": -755.460491302513
            },
            "style": {
              "width": 334.7691678784647,
              "height": 556.7092075584368
            },
            "data": {
              "shapeType": "rectangle",
              "label": "User Persona #2\n\nWho he is: Practices late, \nstudies later. Earbuds \nalways in, notifications \nmostly off.\n\nHabits & prefs: Dark mode, \nhaptics off, hates sudden \nsounds; likes quiet status \ncues.\n\nNeeds: Low-glare UI, gentle\nfeedback, and control over \nalerts.\n",
