            "style": {
              "width": 1038.3082682871354,
              "height": 206.80031657457656
            },
            "data": {
              "shapeType": "rectangle",
              "label": "I picked soft blue and mint as calm “coordination” colors, with a warm apricot accent \nthat feels like an invite. Black is the anchor for high-contrast schedules and codes \nshe’ll share. The rounded display heading reads like a friendly flyer; the clean sans \nbody keeps checklists and instructions easy to scan. Our style words—conscience and \nthoughtful—signal Patch & Play’s eco values and Sophie’s care for her club. Copy uses \n“we” language and clear next steps, so it’s simple to plan and celebrate together. \nNothing shouts; everything guides.",
              "backgroundColor": "transparent",
              "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 20
            },
            "measured": {
