            "data": {
              "shapeType": "rectangle",
              "label": "User Persona #1\n\nWho she is: Varsity winger \n+ part-time barista. Ten-\nminute passing periods are \nher whole window.\n\nHabits & prefs: Saves \nfavorite orders; lactose-\nsensitive; lives in Notes \nand Reminders; cracked \niPhone screen.\n\nNeeds: Speed, price \nclarity, and simple choices\nthat don’t derail her day.\n\n",
              "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
              "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 20
            },
            "measured": {
