              "label": "User Persona #4\n\nWho she is: Club officer, \ngroup-chat admin, event \nplanner in sneakers.\n\nHabits & prefs: Makes \nshared docs; loves \ntemplates; posts recaps, \nnot selfies.\n\nNeeds: Easy ways to \ncoordinate, share, and \ncelebrate together.\n",
              "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
